I'm a System Analyst with an Industrial Engineering background, 1+ year of corporate experience across HR, talent acquisition, and customer relations (Cimory Group and PT Toyota-Astra Motor), and 3+ years of freelance system development since 2023. I turn manual business processes into working systems by mapping how the process runs today, defining clear business rules and data structures, and building tools together with the people who use them.

Since 2023 I have also delivered freelance projects covering Odoo ERP, process simulation, workflow automation, and custom web tools. I'm open to full-time employment, freelance opportunities, and project collaborations across business, technology, and digital transformation, including custom software, workflow automation, data processing, and reporting.
